TI  - DERIVED HECKE ALGEBRA AND COHOMOLOGY OF ARITHMETIC GROUPS AKSHAY VENKA TESH
DA  - D:20190130
UR  - https://arxiv.org/abs/1608.07234
AB  - We describe a graded extension of the usual Hecke algebra: i t acts in a graded fashion on the cohomology of an arithmetic group Γ . Under favorable conditions, the cohomology is freely generated in a single degree over this g raded Hecke algebra. From this construction we extract an action of certainp-adic Galois cohomology groups on H ˚ pΓ , Qpq, and formulate the central conjecture: the motivic Q-lattice inside these Galois cohomology groups preserves H ˚ pΓ , Qq.
ER  - 

