ID  - arxiv-2105.07724v2
AU  - LOUISE SUTTON, DANIEL TUBBENHAUER, PAUL WEDRICH
AU  - JIERUZHU
TI  - SL2 tilting modules in the mixed case
UR  - https://arxiv.org/abs/2105.07724
AB  - Using the non-semisimple Temperley–Lieb calculus, we study the additive and monoidal structure of the category of tilting modules for SL2 in the mixed case. This simultane- ously generalizes the semisimple situation, the case of the complex quantum group at a root of unity, and the algebraic group case in positive characteristic. We describe character formulas and give a presentation of the category of tilting modules as an additive category via a quiver with relations. Turning to the monoidal structure, we describe fusion rules and obtain an explicit recursive description of the appropriate analog of Jones–Wenzl projectors.
ER  - 

