ID  - arxiv-0810.2361v2
AU  - MORTON, JEFFREY C.
TI  - 2-VECTOR SPACES AND GROUPOIDS
DA  - D:20180528
UR  - https://arxiv.org/abs/0810.2361
AB  - This paper describes a relationship between essentially ﬁnite groupoids and 2-vector spaces. In particular, we show to construct 2-vector spaces of Vect-valued presheaves on such groupoids. We deﬁne 2-linear maps corre- sponding to functors between groupoids in both a covariant and contravariant way, which are ambidextrous adjoints. This is used to construct a representation— a weak functor—from Span(FinGpd) (the bicategory of essentially ﬁnite groupoids and spans of groupoids) into 2Vect. In this paper we prove this and give the construction in detail.
ER  - 

